 "_why src/data/union_room.h:messages": "Union Room / wireless group messages: PrintOnTextbox, UR_PrintFieldMessage and ScheduleFieldMessage* draw window 0 = field message box (DrawDialogueFrame / AddTextPrinterForMessage, menu.c sStandardTextBox_WindowTemplates 27 tiles = 216px, x=0); MG_AddMessageTextPrinter / PrintMysteryGiftMenuMessage use mystery_gift_menu.c sMainWindows[WIN_MSG] 28 tiles = 224px, x=0. 208 leaves room for the down arrow. Trainer-card texts (sText_TrainerCardInfoPage*, sGladToMeetYouTexts, sCardColorTexts as {DYNAMIC 2}) go through the same field message.",
 "_why src/data/union_room.h:sText_*PlayerNeeded,sText_*PlayerMode": "PrintNumPlayersWaitingForMsg: PrintUnionRoomText(FONT_NORMAL, x=0) in sWindowTemplate_NumPlayerMode, 7 tiles = 56px.",
 "_why src/data/union_room.h:sText_BButtonCancel,sText_ChooseJoinCancel": "PrintUnionRoomText(FONT_SMALL, x=8) in sWindowTemplate_BButtonCancel, 30 tiles = 240px (normal-font px given; FONT_SMALL is narrower).",
 "_why src/data/union_room.h:sText_EggTrade": "TradeBoardPrintItemInfo: PrintUnionRoomText(FONT_NORMAL, x=68) in sWindowTemplate_TradingBoardMain (28 tiles = 224px); the egg line has no other column after x=68 except the level at ~198.",
 "_why src/data/union_room.h:sText_NameWantedOfferLv": "Header of sWindowTemplate_TradingBoardHeader (28 tiles = 224px) at x=8; column positions are the {CLEAR_TO} codes kept from the original.",
 "_why src/data/union_room.h:menu items": "sText_Greetings/Battle/Chat2/Exit (sInviteToActivityMenuItems), sText_Info/Exit (sRegisterForTradeListMenuItems), sText_Exit (sTradingBoardTypes): ListMenuHandler_AllItemsAvailable sizes the window to Intl_GetListMenuWidth capped at the template width 16 tiles = 128px, items at x=8 -> 120px. sText_Exit2: sTradeBoardListMenuItems in the 28-tile trading board window.",
 "_why src/data/union_room.h:activity names": "sLinkGroupActivityNameTexts entries are only copied to gStringVar1 for sText_AwaitingCommunication, sText_AwaitingLinkPressStart, sText_AwaitingOtherMembers, sText_AreTheseMembersOK, sText_CancelModeWithTheseMembers, sText_ModeWithTheseMembersWillBeCanceled, sText_PlayerContactedYouForXAccept/ShareX: every line containing {STR_VAR_1} there was laid out to fit a 130px name in the 208px message box (original longest name 'BATTLE TOWER OPEN LEVEL' = 129px)."
}